        <h2 class="subhead1">Services</h2><p>We help ensure that Durham has a strong and diverse economy by:</p><ul><li>Helping to increase Durham&rsquo;s commercial tax base</li><li>Preparing our workforce to meet the demands of current and emerging industries</li><li>Promoting long-term economic growth through the revitalization of downtown, urban and targeted suburban areas</li><li>Providing technical and targeted financial assistance for business</li></ul><h2 class="subhead1">Mission</h2><p><span>The Office of Economic and Workforce Development (OEWD) innovatively drives economic prosperity in Durham.</span></p>
    </div>

